{"type":"step-attempt","step":"design","sessionId":"a7e6fa8f-9b02-4354-ad34-b11eb459fae0","outcome":{"verdict":"success","findingsPath":null,"error":null,"toolResult":{"ok":true,"reason":"Wrote design.md, spec.md, tasks.md under specrunner/changes/spec-review-prior-round-context/ on branch change/spec-review-prior-round-context-80e3dc6a.\n\nCentral design decision: the fixer-changed-file derivation requires runtimeStrategy.listCommitChangedFiles (async, core-only), but buildMessage is pure and the existing adapter-invoked enrichContext has no access to runtimeStrategy (AgentRunContext carries state/cwd/dynamicContext but not the port). So the plan derives prior-round context in the core buildStepContext path via a NEW declarative AgentStep hook `prepareRoundContext(state, cwd, runtimeStrategy)`, carries the result on a new inline-typed DynamicContext.priorRoundContext field (one-shot, never persisted), and renders it into the reviewer message via a pure buildPriorRoundContextBlock + new {{PRIOR_ROUND_CONTEXT}} placeholder.\n\nDerivation logic lives in a new module prior-round-context.ts decomposed like finding-recency (pure resolvePriorFixerOid / pure formatter / async wiring). derivePriorRoundContext gates iteration>=2, resolves the latest spec-fixer StepRun.commitOid, calls listCommitChangedFiles, and returns null (omit whole block) when OID missing / seam absent / result unavailable — satisfying the graceful-degradation AC and managed-runtime no-op. Prior findings come from getLatestJudgeFindings(state, SPEC_REVIEW) (previous round at buildMessage time). Re-flag protocol text (re-read / justify insufficiency / preserve full enumeration with no exemption) is baked into the block. Tasks T-01..T-06 map 1:1 to the request's acceptance criteria including the listCommitChangedFiles-mock machine-derivation check and unchanged existing tests.","status":"success"},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-01T10:03:51.505Z","endedAt":"2026-08-01T10:15:50.209Z","commitOid":"d24608a551685c485300591f9a4628db7e633954"}
